# Auto commit and push

After any code or content change in this repo, commit and push to `origin/main` in the same turn. Do not wait to be asked.

- Use a short factual commit message.
- Do not commit `.env`, secrets, `node_modules/`, or `dist/`.
- If push fails, say so. Do not force-push unless the user asks.
